  "The smart calendar app for iPhone. Merge iCloud, Google & Outlook, plan with on-device intelligence, beat procrastination, optimize school holidays & bridge days. The best Apple Calendar alternative for students, ADHD brains and pros.": "专为 iPhone 打造的智能日历 app。合并 iCloud、Google 与 Outlook，用设备端智能规划，战胜拖延，优化学校假期和小长假拼假。它是为学生、ADHD 大脑和职场人打造的最佳 Apple Calendar 替代方案。",
  "Merge all your calendars, plan with on-device intelligence, beat procrastination, and optimize school holidays + bridge days. iPhone only.": "合并你的所有日历，用设备端智能规划，战胜拖延，优化学校假期 + 小长假拼假。仅限 iPhone。",
