  "The smart calendar app for iPhone. Merge iCloud, Google & Outlook, plan with on-device intelligence, beat procrastination, optimize school holidays & bridge days. The best Apple Calendar alternative for students, ADHD brains and pros.": "專為 iPhone 打造的智慧行事曆 App。整合 iCloud、Google 與 Outlook，以裝置端智慧規劃、戰勝拖延，並優化學校假期與連假橋接日。學生、ADHD 族群與上班族的最佳 Apple 行事曆替代品。",
  "Merge all your calendars, plan with on-device intelligence, beat procrastination, and optimize school holidays + bridge days. iPhone only.": "整合你所有的行事曆，以裝置端智慧規劃、戰勝拖延，並優化學校假期與連假橋接日。僅限 iPhone。",
